Modified source: src/FastTree.c, 2026-10-06.
Changes add optional CUDA routing, numerical kernels, resident likelihood
workspaces, verification controls, and executable branding. The unmodified
reference is included for comparison. This is not an official FastTree release.

The small test alignments are excerpts of the upstream FastTree example
alignments (16S and COG), converted to FASTA.
